Subject: [PATCH 1/4] [Perf] Tune GLM-5.3-Flash block-FP8 MoE for H20

Add E=288, N=512 H20 configs and GLM-5.3-Flash model parameter support
in the existing MoE benchmark. Use measured 32-row tiles in the middle
batch region while retaining default configurations where tuning does
not provide a stable benefit.

The 16-row small-batch choice is also covered by LioEinaudi's #47593;
that proposed heuristic was included as an explicit benchmark control.

